行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Supported agents"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"41+ agents out of the box:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"| AdaL | Amp | Antigravity | Augment |\n| Claude Code | Cline | CodeBuddy | Codex |\n| Command Code | "},{"id":"p23s2","text":"Continue | Cortex Code | Crush |\n| Cursor | Droid | Gemini CLI | GitHub Copilot |\n| Goose | iFlow CL"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"I | Junie | Kilo Code |\n| Kimi Code CLI | Kiro CLI | Kode | MCPJam |\n| Mistral Vibe | Mux | Neovate "},{"id":"p23s4","text":"| OpenClaw |\n| OpenCode | OpenHands | Pi | Pochi |\n| Qoder | Qwen Code | Replit | Roo Code |\n| Trae "},{"id":"p23s5","text":"| Trae CN | Windsurf | Zencoder |"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Plus a `universal` fallback for any agent not listed. Add new agents with one line of code."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Cross-device sync"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Config"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"`~/AISkills/config.yaml`:"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## Language"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"- Node.js 18+\n- Windows / macOS / Linux"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"**Windows** uses Junction links — no admin rights needed.\n**macOS / Linux** uses native symlinks."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
